    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d409">

                <pb facs="0434" n="424" sameAs="frus:frus1944v04/pg424"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">852.75 National Telephone Co./417a:
                    Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in Spain</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Hayes</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1944-03-29T20:00:00-04:00">March 29, 1944—8
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>877. In view of urgency of ITT matters now pending with Spanish Government and of
                    possibility that delaying tactics may be employed deliberately, you are
                    requested to ask the Spanish Government to furnish you, in reply to your note
                    supporting the ITT complaints and claims, its assurance that the complaints and
                    claims will be examined and given prompt consideration in the light of the terms
                    of the concession, and that pending a final decision neither the present
                    majority stockholder position of ITT nor the present CTNE position will be
                    affected or disturbed by any demands of the Government. It is felt <pb
                        facs="0435" n="425" xml:id="pg425"/> that without some such assurance the
                    properties and interests of the ITT are not safeguarded in a manner to permit
                    continuing negotiations in an orderly fashion.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
